ively spliced transcript variants encoding different isoforms have been found for this gene. [provided by RefSeq, Apr 2010].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q6XE24","text":"Binds poly(A) and poly(U) oligoribonucleotides."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}